# Things fleetd no longer has. CI (.github/site-check.mjs) fails when a line of site/home.html, site/fleetd.txt or
# site/README.md matches one of these: a case-insensitive JavaScript regex per line, # starts a comment.

# The old phone app (a PWA with web push) is gone. The phone app (W158) and its notifications (D218) are not a PWA,
# and fleetd has iOS and Android apps again.
\bPWA\b
progressive web app
web push
mobile app
\bfor (iOS|android)\b
home screen

# fleetd installs with `curl -fsSL https://fleetd.sh | sh` (or a GitHub release), never from npm.
\bnpx\b
\bnpm (i|install|add)\b
\b(pnpm|yarn) (add|dlx)\b
install(ed|s|ing)? (fleetd )?(via|with|through|using) npm

# T3 Code is gone: the node runs the claude CLI itself, and `fleetd machine add` installs nothing from npm.
\bT3\b
\bt3code\b
T3 Code
from npm

# Sessions use the user's own claude setup (~/.claude); fleetd keeps no claude profile of its own.
\.fleetd/claude\b(?!\.env)
CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=~/\.fleetd

# The GPUI app (fleetd-app) is gone: the desktop app is the Electron one in app/desktop.
\bfleetd-app\b
\bGPUI\b
\bfleetd-bench\b

# A project's slot share is now its max agents.
project's (slot )?share\b

# Leads ask in the project's chat now (lead-chat): no ask tool, no inbox, no question cards, no fleetd answer.
question card
\binbox\b
\bfleetd answer\b
# `answer` written as a command (`answer`, `answer --key-file …`), with or without fleetd.
`answer[` ]
\binbox_reply\b
\basks_list\b
recs fine

# The train's freeze, stacked-PR builds and opt-in GitHub webhooks are gone: the `hold` label holds a PR.
train_freeze
github-webhook
fleetd/stack

# The memory budget is gone: the caps alone hold agents back, never the memory an agent is estimated to take.
memory budget
seen on this project
